OL,3,A'We screwed up': Doordash admits
OL,4,Aunderpaying New York workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FDoorDash has agreed to pay a $131.5m
OL,7,F(#99m) settlement to New York City
OL,8,Fregulators after the food delivery
OL,9,Fgiant admitted failing to compensate
OL,10,Fthousands of workers correctly or on
OL,11,Ftime.
OL,13,F"Simply put, we screwed up," DoorDash
OL,14,Fsaid. "Our mistakes meant some Dashers
OL,15,Fwere underpaid or paid late."
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
