OL,3,A'We screwed up': Doordash admits
OL,4,Aunderpaying New York workers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe agreement with the Department of
OL,7,FConsumer and Worker Protection follows
OL,8,Fa city investigation into wage
OL,9,Fviolations, with a significant share of
OL,10,Fthe payout addressing how DoorDash
OL,11,Fcalculates compensation for the time
OL,12,Fdelivery drivers spend waiting for
OL,13,Forders.
OL,15,FThe settlement marks another chapter in
OL,16,Fan ongoing battle between so-called gig
OL,17,Feconomy platforms and municipal
OL,18,Fleaders.
